# Source and text files keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
# `text=auto` alone would hand Windows checkouts CRLF, which is harmless for
# rustc but makes any test comparing multi-line output platform-dependent.
*.rs    text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf

# Everything else: let git decide, and never touch binaries.
* text=auto
*.png binary
*.pem binary
